From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Opus 5.5" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:33:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/25] Report Bug to the real tracker; OpenAL Soft and
 freealut in licenses.txt

ReportBugURL points at https://github.com/Shoalstone/ibasho/issues (it was a
placeholder). licenses.txt gains OpenAL Soft and freealut: LGPL, unmodified,
with where their complete source is.
---
 indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml |  4 ++--
 indra/newview/licenses-win32.txt        | 20 ++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml b/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
index 1d169a9..0e20aa8 100644
--- a/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
+++ b/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
@@ -10286,13 +10286,13 @@
 		<key>ReportBugURL</key>
 		<map>
 			<key>Comment</key>
-			<string>Ibasho: URL used for filing bugs from the viewer (Help &gt; Report Bug): Ibasho's issue tracker, not Linden Lab's. PLACEHOLDER until the project is published: put the real repository here.</string>
+			<string>Ibasho: URL used for filing bugs from the viewer (Help &gt; Report Bug): Ibasho's issue tracker, not Linden Lab's.</string>
 			<key>Persist</key>
 			<integer>1</integer>
 			<key>Type</key>
 			<string>String</string>
 			<key>Value</key>
-			<string>https://github.com/OWNER/ibasho/issues</string>
+			<string>https://github.com/Shoalstone/ibasho/issues</string>
 		</map>
 	<key>RevokePermsOnStopAnimation</key>
     <map>
diff --git a/indra/newview/licenses-win32.txt b/indra/newview/licenses-win32.txt
index 8e81e47..99ce931 100644
--- a/indra/newview/licenses-win32.txt
+++ b/indra/newview/licenses-win32.txt
@@ -1,7 +1,8 @@
 Licenses of the third-party software in this build of Ibasho (see also About > Licenses).
 Modified for Ibasho (2026-10-23): entries for software Ibasho doesn't include removed (the Logitech
-LCD SDK, FSI FontShop's Meta fonts, glh, Kakadu's JPEG2000, xmlrpc-epi, google-perftools) and
-OpenJPEG's license added (Ibasho decodes JPEG2000 with OpenJPEG).
+LCD SDK, FSI FontShop's Meta fonts, glh, Kakadu's JPEG2000, xmlrpc-epi, google-perftools);
+OpenJPEG's license added (Ibasho decodes JPEG2000 with OpenJPEG); OpenAL Soft and freealut, with
+where their source is.
 
